station-dive-sender = Dive Control
station-dive-warning-first = All hands, prepare to dive. We go under in one minute. All personnel return aboard and secure the airlocks.
station-dive-warning-last = DIVING IN TEN SECONDS. Secure all airlocks. Anyone outside will be left behind!
station-dive-started = All hands, we are under. Keep the airlocks sealed and stay inside the hull until we reach the surface.
station-dive-landing = All hands, seabed in sight. We settle on the bottom shortly. Secure any loose equipment.
station-dive-liftoff-warning = LIFTING OFF THE BOTTOM IN {$seconds} SECONDS. All personnel return aboard. Anyone outside will be left behind!
station-dive-liftoff-abort-announcement = Lift-off aborted. The station stays on the bottom.
station-dive-resurface-announcement = The station has begun to resurface. It will reach the surface in {$time} {$units}.
station-dive-abort-announcement = Resurfacing aborted. The station is heading back down.
station-dive-surfaced = The station has reached the surface. The shift is over.
station-dive-too-far = The current pushes you back toward the station.

